Insert UTF-8 IM commits in the X11 editor.

XmbLookupString returns committed IM text as UTF-8. The X11 key path converted
the returned buffer to one Unicode codepoint, but the editor only inserted
values below 255, so CJK commits were discarded. Multi-codepoint commits also
arrived as one X event while xwpe's input API returns only one int at a time.

Queue the remaining UTF-8 bytes locally and let subsequent e_x_getch/e_x_kbhit
calls return the rest. Treat codepoints above xwpe's private key range as text.

